# Vercel hosts ONLY the static frontend (app/webapp). The Python compute backend
# (JAX + gmsh, ~1.4 GB of dependencies, 90 s solves, stateful JIT cache) cannot run
# as a serverless function — deploy it with the Dockerfile instead. See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
*
!app/
app/*
!app/webapp/
!app/webapp/**
!vercel.json
